# Every text file is LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of
# core.autocrlf: on a Windows checkout CRLF would fail Prettier on every file.
# The last matching line wins, so specific rules stay below this one.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
